ding a cure a ready  cure for sickle cell disorder  so i think that when you think about new  technologies for instance like gene  therapy  which is really a cure in itself when  you think about how to come about  treating sickle cell disease there's  hope but we need to actually really do  more and be able to come up with  innovative ways and mechanisms for which  we can address sickle cell in a manner  that supports the infrastructure that we  have within africa building up  capabilities continuing to build up  sustainable ways for which the  healthcare ecosystem can support new  technologies coming in  that will  really be able to democracize  availability as well as accessibility  for these innovative therapies and  that's what's going to be important for  driving um and and being able to address  and provide cures for sickle cell  all right delilah from 54 gene thanks  for speaking to us  thank you
 

